  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 200°C. Lightly oil a baking dish large enough to hold the cod in a single layer.",
    "Spread the tomatoes, onion and garlic in the dish. Drizzle with olive oil, lemon juice and half the parsley, then season with oregano, salt and black pepper.",
    "Nestle the cod fillets into the tomato mixture and spoon a little of the juices over the top.",
    "Bake for 18 to 22 minutes, until the cod is opaque and flakes easily and the tomatoes are soft and bubbling.",
    "Scatter over the remaining parsley and serve hot, ideally with potatoes, rice or crusty bread if desired."
